* Tried to used confused uncursed scrolls of teleport instead of cursed
(I had about 12 of them).  Advice for anyone else wanting to try that.
Don't.
Find or make some unholy water and curse the scrolls.  It makes things
much easier.  I ended up walking down from level 1 to level 30 where I
found a level teleporter.
* Went to the VS, grabbed the amulet and ran.  The mysterious force
didn't
affect me at all for the first 10 levels, then it kicked in with a
vengence.
* Got to the planes, used confused gold detection and an assortment of
rings to help me through. Conflict for all, warning for earth,
levitation
for air, fire and water and free action for astral.
* Visited all three altars to find my one.  With the ring of conflict,
I didn't even need to bring out any of my healing potions.

